  <item>
    <title>E05.冤魂低语未解谜，夜半回声诉真相：台湾嘉义甘蔗园谋杀案</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674fbc4f17cd5416ad49879b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">674fbc4f17cd5416ad49879b</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 04 Dec 2024 06:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【声明】</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>本期节目涉及一些灵异的破案过程，不适合晚上深夜自己一人收听哦（我本人写这个稿子时都起鸡皮疙瘩）（胆大的除外）。建议14岁以下的由家人陪同收听。</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>【本期案件】</span></p><span></span><p><span>一片寂静的甘蔗园，却埋藏着一个永不安息的秘密。2007年，台湾嘉义县发生了一起令人毛骨悚然的谋杀案，受害者阿如离奇失踪，数日后被发现惨死在甘蔗田中。案情扑朔迷离，灵异传闻接踵而至——有人声称在深夜听到冤魂的低语，也有人说见到模糊的身影徘徊田间。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这究竟是亡灵的呐喊，还是案件背后藏着更大的真相？在本期节目中，我们将梳理案情线索，直面甘蔗园的诡异传说，探寻血腥与灵异交织的真相迷雾。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期图片】</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>* 建议边听边看show notes！</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnuBp06OUfwujdnWTxlnqxW90dbA.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>案发现场的塑胶管</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnMv-XLCFg4lJzPwFugFWfjtQqSV.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoFi_szz1RwwxnZCLhC4Zx9ZK7za.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>烧焦的手表</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhJZ07Pohi5eTJqJrNaHXrlDmKUg.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Foz-4Jd36JdbMpXB_YSUxed7Uez_.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>烧焦的手机</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsg-j5olv2hykc0VIvgscBiR27Nr.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>警方修复过后的SIM卡</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiHAH-Aa-GnxBCzjTYAAI2LCsCeY.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>调取关键录像的加油站</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn4NszQhVsgcUHu5mFtDhXPV4wtr.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu2mxavpnGxY8EsaULwHmjMJgVH_.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>犯罪车辆（灰蓝色现代牌轿车）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnvg_FJHxeOPwf9KTYE4AigVvHTL.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjb6vce6MX-_SucPASSyF8fwAPt9.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr26CPOvWj-wlV3bAIsYEPaJMCmz.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsyn9R--j69K9JQK70kVXqZHa1M2.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>车内发现的与案发现场相符的植被以及脚垫上沾有的汽油</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs8B0OwMIDZmXCEEhwtOGe1ludkF.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>陈瑞祥案发时穿的衣服</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnpUltPjO5xpDDE0U-fAr1glUjvB.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnc3wQoyZoP2cQuwSsyrEzWIOhxL.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>陈瑞祥到现场指认并道歉</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrW5E9jr_dgn6mBvM4BP00-XR2Q2.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqgpzctWiC4WYE6TIbT7ZtKADKN4.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuBG4aJnVS254VC2TNU62KE1kWhX.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>台湾台南强盗案发现的证物</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl1z8oBpUxmfwY19fHYI1gXWjADz.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>警方逮捕了患有膀胱癌的陈瑞祥，病恹恹的坐在家里的客厅</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Highlights】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="433">07:13</a> 目击者报警，神秘电话打进</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="437">07:17</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1017">16:57</a> &nbsp;死者身份确认，嫌疑犯出现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1896">31:36</a> &nbsp;嫌犯狡猾撒谎，最终逮捕归案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1910">31:50</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2156">35:56</a> 办案灵异，疑似冤魂索命</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2165">36:05</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2313">38:33</a> 再次犯案，本性难改</span></p><span></span><p><span>【参考资料】</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>* 台湾启示录20231112期</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>【片尾曲】</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>* 蔡健雅—《善良的我们》</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>【最后的最后】</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. 您可以在</span><em><strong><span>网易云，Apple播客 </span></strong></em><span>搜索 </span><em><strong><span>迷雾之下 </span></strong></em><span>找到我</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. 微博：迷雾之下_</span></p><span></span><p><span>3. 小红书：迷雾之下（有重名的，我的账号是799454377）</span></p><span></span><p><span>4. 邮箱：3961503550@qq.com （欢迎反馈）</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>想说的话有很多，之后想单独开一期跟大家聊聊，总之，谢谢大家！</span></strong></em></p>]]></description>
