  <item>
    <title>E03.停摆的劳力士，重启的真相：英国最完美的谋杀案揭秘</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/673dae3511045e78e58c3a60</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">673dae3511045e78e58c3a60</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 20 Nov 2024 09:46:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期案件】</span></p><span></span><p><span>1996年，一起看似完美的谋杀案震惊整个英国。一块停摆的劳力士手表、漂白水抹去的血迹、父女间难以言说的关系、身份和秘密的阴谋。从身份盗用到船上的致命一夜，警方是如何一步一步解开这场惊天迷案？欢迎收听本期节目，让我们一起走进这场猫鼠游戏，揭开那个不可告人的真相。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Highlights】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">2:25</a> &nbsp;故事开始，发现尸体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="723">12:03</a> 身份之谜，谁又是谁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1571">26:11</a> &nbsp;发现赃物，准备潜逃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1896">31:36</a> &nbsp;惊天大贼，真实身份</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2208">36:48</a> &nbsp;最后一刻，如何博弈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2428">40:28</a> &nbsp;故事结尾，谢谢收听</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2496">41:36</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;一首Billie Eilish 的《birds of a feather》送给大家</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本案相关图片】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnQ_yYlt_iLZhfL2uyWYcR_J3OcG.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>老罗（Ronald Joseph Platt）本人</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj10ccIVPKj1-yaai4PfDMtYgeSV.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>手上的枫叶纹身</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvKPabcv4T1_1NVGw0poUtJApbcH.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>尸体头部的伤痕</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrmUFTPMcFvOd_kSb_CgHrgpM-VT.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>凶器（锚)</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmVbRt2eaLxF9egwJBkB5UY2ITE9.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>老戴/阿尔伯特（David Davis）（Albert Johnson Walker）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo6g646-a_rwmi9R3vExr2ce7-3q.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Lady Jane 船的照片</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpvMgOhaiZJzLnPRyeez7fYpM968.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>老罗的前女友艾琳娜</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn5nXKsXL3W06ad_GFSxGTHXI3vU.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>老罗，老戴，和艾琳娜聚会的照片</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgVw5PACRbpoM3L4LdmSbH1yxiWK.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>老戴的女儿希纳</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgSljn0Nq4BLF4umbgXNNgiFYldg.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>老戴/阿尔伯特的家庭照</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FutbRzXRohmNtmjU1zpKL-uAMlRU.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>阿尔伯特1980年创立的沃克公司</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuLOrJF5dxZPBoqSkgQyZ4T-rJkE.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>老戴/阿尔伯特的指纹</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjr_PDa4BZjpB9fXZll5AgQo64fH.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>家中发现的赃款</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjZ1pN1p9z8ZDzyp4onNKHY7DJHk.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>16世纪荷兰画家林布兰的真迹</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsqVd863NdwRopdUpnGMRi6rHiKa.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>会说话的停摆的劳力士手表</span></p><span></span><p><span>谢谢大家的收听，欢迎留言一起探讨，喜欢的话别忘记订阅和分享，祝大家有个美好的一天~</span></p>]]></description>
