    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期案件】</span></p><span></span><p><span>1997年3月15日，16岁的高中女生真锅和加在结束了她的最后一天打工后离奇失踪，几天之后尸体被找到。凶手找到了吗?他究竟是谁?香川县的那个笼罩在未知的恐惧中的夜空，你，准备好迎接了吗?</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Highlights】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="92">01:32</a> 人物梗概</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="495">08:15</a> 父母寻找，警方介入</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="828">13:48</a> 目击者报警，尸体被发现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1100">18:20</a> 线索出现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1397">23:17</a> 人物现状</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本案相关图片】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmmIGhrP4Qu1fXeoMuU-1ekMH4X2.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>主人公真锅和加</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlhsmOghWvofGY3vuSTFwDP6F5Cq.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>失踪当天穿的T恤</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtpesJ0-oLvjAfcFGwwtWim7crv1.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>打工的便利店门口</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoD_Zavb2WVLPadiHHf0j-Z5b8iR.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>尸体被发现的地方</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoI4IXk7w8IrV79OctZsaZ6C5WL5.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>封锁现场图</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrAJJfCQjGGb6SXeIx8_IVJm9KPh.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>案件相关的地理位置</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoUVOMuRASPIkdaKCh-XCCAhmsgL.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>父亲真锅宜之</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqdzq9LqEcOl-pZdnkfiZE0VO2zb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>母亲真锅明美</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp018kQGnF24syx0-L0is5WcNQdy.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>2024年依旧奔波宣传</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtO399T61Wd_cIRA2GW8OrKXQ_XV.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>75岁的明美守护着两个过世的亲人</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoHtSrESFqSBRa4YUeQExwjwnI0y.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>当年的悬赏令</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtfpNsdg7FWfqsVFDwMUPJBhwsc5.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>明美的高中同学白山大介</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢大家的收听，如果喜欢我的节目的话，欢迎订阅、评论以及分享。希望能在大家的帮助下，让这档播客越来越好~</span></p>]]></description>
