    <title>E01.我梦到了他的杀戮：美国北卡罗莱纳州连环失踪杀人案。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/672b4e166c53cd405a6774ea</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">672b4e166c53cd405a6774ea</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 06 Nov 2024 12:06:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期案件】</span></p><span></span><p><span>1992年9月，在美国McDowell,North Carolina小镇上，同一家庭的两个表亲在同一年失踪：Zilpha和Jeremiah。在Jeremiah失踪之后，Zilpha在梦中曾经梦到过凶手，紧接着她也消失不见。这梦境究竟是无意义的臆想？还是罪案的真实映射?随着一个名叫Greene的新警探介入调查，这起案件从沉寂的档案中被重新挖出。错综复杂的线索、亲人之间的猜疑、利益纠缠的背后……在雾霭之中，真相究竟离我们有多远?</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Highlights】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="79">01:19</a> 人物简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="199">03:19</a> 目睹火灾现场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="438">07:18</a> 离奇梦境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="755">12:35</a> Greene的探案之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="964">16:04</a> 家人提供线索</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1686">28:06</a> 真正的凶手</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本案相关图片】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fiwt4wyJ0SWqe60UOKEetq_W2JTC.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Zilpha Lowery 和 Jeremiah Pittman</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtKCPSEHNtZu3hdf7IS6OxRHgWKc.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Zilpha案发当年的照片</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl2jDwM3SeCsUIjcuIfhl9X0l0P8.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Zilpha的姐姐Reba Lowery</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuv5fX3-nRSQs-AVP-b8DN0H1LC1.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Jeremiah的父亲 Eddie Pittman</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrgqQfSlGu1z9LMlraZWvmi5mY52.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>杀害Zilpha的凶手Bobby Taylor （Robert Taylor）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoW3dFKVC7Cj1aoCiCX5Fehoc4NR.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Eddie女友 Rosemary</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjzMn4f1q-FNdaVCGwiPNx_ZYHBj.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>警探Greene</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢大家收听迷雾之下，大家如果喜欢我的节目，欢迎订阅、评论以及分享。当然有什么意见或者建议都可以在评论区留言。希望能在大家的帮助下，让这档播客越来越好~</span></p>]]></description>
